
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/static/images/logotab.png" type="image/x-icon">

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>

  <title>Meet The Team | Bookwell</title>
</head>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-100 to-violet-100 dark:from-gray-900 dark:to-gray-950 dark:text-white min-h-screen">

  {% include "components/navbar.html.jinja" %}

  <section class="text-center px-6 pt-20 pb-14">

    <div class="inline-block bg-violet-200 dark:bg-violet-900/40 text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-300 px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-6 shadow-sm">
      The Developers Behind Bookwell
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-800 dark:text-white leading-tight">
      Meet Our Team
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-8 text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      We are full stack development students from the Brooklyn STEAM Center passionate about building
      technology that solves real-world problems. Bookwell was created to simplify appointment booking,
      reduce scheduling frustration, and make healthcare management more accessible for everyone.
    </p>

  </section>


  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">

      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">

        <div class="h-28 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 to-purple-500"></div>

        <div class="px-8 pb-8 -mt-16 text-center">

          <img
            src="/static/members/Prity.png"
            alt="Prity"
            class="w-32 h-32 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-gray-800 mx-auto shadow-lg"
          >

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
            Prity
          </h2>

          <p class="text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 font-semibold mt-1">
            Full Stack Developer
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Hi, my name is Jannatul Prity. I am a Full Stack Developer currently studying at the Brooklyn
            STEAM Center, where I am learning the skills and tools needed to become a successful developer.
            I aspire to use technology to create solutions that improve people's everyday lives.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-3">
              Contributions
            </h3>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Frontend Design</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Backend Logic</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Database Work</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/JannatulP49"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block mt-7 bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition duration-300"
          >
            View GitHub
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>



      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">

        <div class="h-28 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-violet-500"></div>

        <div class="px-8 pb-8 -mt-16 text-center">

          <img
            src="/static/members/ASANAH1.jpg"
            alt="Sanah"
            class="w-32 h-32 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-gray-800 mx-auto shadow-lg"
          >

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
            Sanah
          </h2>

          <p class="text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 font-semibold mt-1">
            Full Stack Developer
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Hello, my name is Sanah White and I am currently a senior at the Brooklyn STEAM Center pursuing
            full stack development. I enjoy creating clean user experiences and learning new technologies.
            My goal is to become a software engineer in the future.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-3">
              Contributions
            </h3>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">UI Development</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Responsive Design</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Testing</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/Sanahw7"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block mt-7 bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition duration-300"
          >
            View GitHub
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">

        <div class="h-28 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-violet-500"></div>

        <div class="px-8 pb-8 -mt-16 text-center">

          <img
            src="/static/members/jahmere.jpeg"
            alt="Jahmere"
            class="w-32 h-32 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-gray-800 mx-auto shadow-lg"
          >

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
            Jahmere
          </h2>

          <p class="text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 font-semibold mt-1">
            Full Stack Developer
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Hi, my name is Jahmere and I am a developer at the Brooklyn STEAM Center. I enjoy building
            modern applications, learning new programming concepts, and collaborating with teams to create
            impactful digital experiences.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-3">
              Contributions
            </h3>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Authentication</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">API Integration</span>
              <span class="bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Optimization</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/JahmereStacks"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block mt-7 bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition duration-300"
          >
            View GitHub
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    <section class="mt-24 text-center">

      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
        Technologies We Used
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Bookwell was built using modern development tools and frameworks focused on performance,
        accessibility, and clean design.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-10">

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md font-semibold">
          Flask
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md font-semibold">
          TailwindCSS
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md font-semibold">
          JavaScript
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md font-semibold">
          HTML
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md font-semibold">
          Python
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>

</html>

